# ROOFCAT: after the ending the chase goes round again after dark, keeping
# score and lives. Clearing the second loop earns the Alien.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 4 1
cheat arena
wait 10
cheat win
wait 240
expect state == 4
wait 250
press A
wait 5
expect loop == 2
expect area == 0
cheat area 4 2
cheat arena
wait 10
cheat win
wait 240
expect state == 4
expect goals & 4
